	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. in domino.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Mirari desine; nulla erat occasio neque argumentum scri<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>bendi neque tabellarius commodus.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Nunc dato argumento hęc placuit scribere: <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>In <placeName ref="l830">Anglia</placeName> omnia tumultuantur; protector regis est captus et obtruncatus <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>contra regis voluntatem; Caesareanę sunt practicę; cupiunt isti homines <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>Christum ex <placeName ref="l830">Anglia</placeName> eiicere et <placeName ref="l832">Gallo</placeName> negotium facessere.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z6"/><persName ref="p8354">Georgius Laetus</persName> apud nos fuit iis diebus, qui narravit <placeName ref="l303">Magdeburgenses</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>optimas pacis conditiones habere.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Dimiserunt dimidiam militum partem, <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>reliquam apud se servant conditionibus pacis parum fidentes.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Liberati sunt <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>a pfaffis omnino et nunc incipiunt męnia reficere et propugnacula <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>fortiora erigere, commeatum comparant ad annos aliquot.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><placeName>Mechlinensis</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>dux cum reliquis nobilibus dimissus est, qui quotidie in captivitate sua <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>contiones evangelicas audivit et iam incipit infensissimus esse sacrificis, <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>si probo animo facit, laudandus, si fucato, habebit pręmium dignum <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>sua hypocrisi.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Aiunt illum <placeName ref="l142">Erfordiam</placeName> voluisse clam occupare; sed frustratus <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>est.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Secessit in <placeName ref="l1875">Hildesheimensis</placeName> episcopi agrum cum milite; fama est milit m <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>iussu <persName ref="p18477">F[erdinandi]</persName> regis hybernare in episcoporum agris, quem ad futurum ver in <placeName ref="l882">Hungariam</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>ducturus est; de qua re audiemus brevi certiora.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z18"/>Gratias ago pro novis ex <placeName ref="l882">Hungaria</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Certum est monachum in cardinalem <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>esse creatum propter <placeName ref="l869">Transylvanię</placeName> proditionem.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Crudele erit bellum inter regem <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>et <placeName ref="l2510">Turcam</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Ex literis domini <persName>Lazii Wiennensis</persName> habeo hęc."</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Fama certa habet <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>tyrannum <placeName ref="l2510">Turcarum</placeName> (nisi deus omnipotens prohibeat) ad futuram aestatem cum <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>innumerabilibus copiis ingressurum praestruente id et curante inimicissimo <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>christiani nominis hoste, rege vestro, imo <persName>Henrico Francorum</persName>.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Quamobrem inter saxum <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>et sacrum positi sumus; sed speramus in deum, qui regi nostro iam aliquot victorias <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>in <placeName ref="l882">Ungaria</placeName> adversus <placeName ref="l2510">Thurcas</placeName> obiecit una cum <placeName ref="l869">Transylvania</placeName> tota ex insperato.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Non enim diffidere possum, quin deus optimus maximus talis sit auditurus principes <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>preces, qui in publica supplicatione tam devote per integram horam procumbens <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>in genua publice oravit, id quod facere eum quotidie privatim camerarii mihi <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>referunt.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Consolantur me et vaticinia quędam vetustissima a me reperta, <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>in quibus mentio fuit ad proximum annum 1552 <placeName ref="l2510">Turcam</placeName> ingentem in <placeName ref="l850">Austria</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>cladem passurum.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">E quorum numero et illud est eleganti carmine scriptum membrana <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>ante annos plures quam 400, habeoque adhuc archetypum:</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z33"/>Orbe <persName>Philippea</persName> descendet origine Caesar,<lb type="manual"/> <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>Qui mundi iusto vindicet ense nephas.<lb type="manual"/></s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z35"/>Hic sternet <placeName ref="l832">Gallos</placeName>, <placeName ref="l522">Venetos</placeName> fundetque <placeName ref="l830">Britannos</placeName>,<lb type="manual"/> <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>Quisquis et in talem verteris arma ducem.<lb type="manual"/></s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z37"/>Unanimi sensuque coli studioque perenni<lb type="manual"/> <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>Instituet summi numina trina dei.<lb type="manual"/></s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z39"/>C<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>uncta reformabit, quę trux <persName>Fredericus</persName> et eius<lb type="manual"/> <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Subvertit soboles saeva suusque sequax.<lb type="manual"/></s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Teque etiam iniusti privans diademate regni<lb type="manual"/> <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>Ad veram coget, <placeName ref="l2510">Turca</placeName>, venire fidem.<lb type="manual"/></s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z5"/>Hic sub apostolico <persName>Romano</persName> ponet in agnos<lb type="manual"/> <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>Vi Danaos Romae sic patientur onus<lb type="manual"/> <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>Et trahet ad Christum Mahumeti et Marte sequaces.<lb type="manual"/></s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z8"/>Sic uni causae pastor et unus er<lb xml:id="p2z9"/>it.<lb type="manual"/></s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z10"/>Quum ter quinque ierint a Christo secula<note type="misc">seculo geschr.</note> nato.<lb type="manual"/></s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z11"/>Et bis ter novus solis et annus erit, <lb type="manual"/><lb xml:id="p2z12"/>Tempus erit, sub quo <placeName ref="l104">Cremonam</placeName> Crema cremabit<lb type="manual"/> <persName>Karolus</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>orbor honor, orbis et ipse decus."<lb type="manual"/></s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Hęc ille.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">Non credo vetusta esse carmina; for<lb xml:id="p2z14"/>tassis sic illudun<lb xml:id="p2z15"/>t principibus viris.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="de">23. decembris 1551.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la">T[uus] <persName ref="p1278">Ga[stius</persName>].</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="de">Dem hochwürdigen <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>und hochglerten herren meyster <persName ref="p495">Heinrych Bullinger</persName>, lutpriest<lb xml:id="p2z17"/>er zuͦ <lb xml:id="p2z18"/><placeName ref="l587">Zurich</placeName>, mynem gunstigen herren, <lb xml:id="p2z19"/>zuͦ handen.</s>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z20"/><placeName ref="l587">Zurich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
